0:{"buildId":"-cWzmSOyU1muirH5dfsk2","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Improve Landing Pages to Break Even and Scale High CPC Traffic\",\"description\":\"Reverse-engineer your paid traffic maths. At $50 CPC and $200 AOV you need 25% CVR to break even - an impossible target. Here's the formula that shows you exactly what your landing page must deliver before you touch your bids.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-25\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/cpc-break-even-landing-page\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent","children":"Paid Traffic Economics"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mb-6 heading-1 leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg lg:text-5xl","children":"Improve Landing Pages to Break Even and Scale High CPC Traffic"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Most founders set their bids, launch campaigns, and then wonder why paid traffic doesn't work. The maths was never going to allow it. Before you optimise a single headline or swap a button colour, you need to know the exact conversion rate your page must hit just to stop losing money - and whether that number is even achievable given your price point."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-cpc-break-even-landing-page&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The Backwards Planning Failure"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted mb-4","children":"The standard playbook goes: choose keywords, set bids, build a landing page, watch what happens. The problem is that every step in that sequence is backwards. You're committing to a cost before you know what outcome the cost requires."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted mb-4","children":"When a founder sets a $50 CPC, they've implicitly agreed to pay $50 every time someone arrives on their page. They haven't asked the prior question: given my price and margin, how many of those arrivals need to buy just to cover the ad spend? Until you answer that, you're not running a campaign - you're running a lottery and hoping the numbers work out."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted mb-4","children":"Page quality is treated as a post-launch creative problem when it is actually a pre-launch financial constraint. The page has to hit a specific CVR threshold or the business model is mathematically unsound at that CPC. Optimising the page after the fact is closing the stable door; the financial structure should determine the page brief before a single word is written."}]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9"]}]]}],null,"$La"]}],"isPartial":"$@b","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Ld","isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":"$11"},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTime":"$c","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@14","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@15"}
